GoshLauncher is a fork of Ulauncher v6 (https://github.com/Ulauncher/Ulauncher),
with its launcher UI redesigned to follow Spotlight-goshos
(https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/spotlight-goshos).

It is distributed under the GNU GPL v3.0, inherited from Ulauncher. See LICENSE.


Ulauncher (upstream code base)
------------------------------
Copyright (C) 2015 Aleksandr Gornostal <ulauncher.app@gmail.com>
and the Ulauncher contributors, including Albin Larsson and Troy Curtis.

Most of ulauncher/ is Ulauncher's work: the mode system, the extension API and
extension IPC, the preferences window, the CLI, and the packaging.


GoshLauncher (this fork, from August 2026)
------------------------------------------
Copyright (C) 2026 the GoshLauncher contributors <https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/GoshLauncher>

The Qt 6 + KDE Kirigami popup, the Spotlight-goshos search order and looks, and
the rebrand are the changes made here. Ulauncher does not endorse them.


Vendored third-party code
-------------------------
ulauncher/utils/ewmh.py is a copy of pyewmh (https://github.com/parkouss/pyewmh),
Copyright (C) 2011-2017 Julien Pages, under the GNU LGPL v3.0. It keeps that
licence; the notice is in the file and in debian/copyright.


Spotlight-goshos (design and behaviour reference)
-------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/spotlight-goshos

Not vendored. The modules under ulauncher/modes/launcher/ name the goshos source
file each one follows.
